  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi! I record *a lot* of first-person VRChat content, but one of the most annoying things is how I have to hide the HUD and nametags to maintain full immersion and have the recording look good.\nI'd love for there to be an option to disable nametags/HUD only in the desktop \"spectator\" window, so I can still tell if I'm muted or not with it (and UI sounds) off.\nAt the current moment, I disable everything for recordings to look the best, but I always have to check my quick menu when I mute + unmute or need to see people's names.",
